_modules/.astro/sessions\"}}}}","astro-version","7.2.2","content-config-digest","e9f0f3424d34e8e7","posts",["Map",11,12],"hello-world",{"id":11,"data":13,"body":17,"filePath":18,"digest":19,"deferredRender":20},{"title":14,"description":15,"publishedAt":16},"Hello World","My first post on this blog — a quick introduction to who I am, what I build, and what you can expect to find here.",["Date","2026-06-27T00:00:00.000Z"],"# Hello World\n\nWelcome to my blog. I'm **Lucas Souza**, an AI Engineer and Tech Writer based in Brazil.\n\n## What I'll Write About\n\nThis blog is a space where I document what I'm learning, building, and thinking about — mostly at the intersection of:\n\n- **AI Engineering** — LLMs, agents, RAG pipelines, and production ML systems\n- **Developer Experience** — tools, workflows, and the craft of writing good software\n- **Technical Writing** — making complex ideas clear and useful\n\n## Why Start Now\n\nI've been meaning to do this for a while. The truth is, writing forces you to understand things more deeply. If you can't explain it clearly, you don't understand it well enough yet.\n\nSo here we go.\n\n---\n\nThanks for reading. More posts coming soon.","src/content/posts/hello-world/index.mdx","59e84846fe026a7c",true]